## Important Detection Scope

DET-006 identifies:

```text
Remote network authentication
```

DET-006 does **not independently prove**:

```text
Administrative share access
Malicious lateral movement
Credential compromise
Unauthorized access
```

Those conclusions require additional context.

This scope limitation is intentional.

The previous version of DET-006 treated Event ID 4624 too broadly and described the behavior as remote administrative SMB activity without sufficient supporting telemetry.

