## Positive Validation

Controlled remote network activity was generated from:

```text
WIN11-01
```

to:

```text
WIN11-02
```

using:

```text
corp\tadmin
```

against:

```text
\\WIN11-02\IPC$
```

Test command:

```cmd
net use \\WIN11-02\IPC$ /user:corp\tadmin *
```

The resulting authentication generated network-logon telemetry matching the tuned DET-006 conditions.

```text
Positive Test:
PASS
```

